{"unit_id":"baisama-cloud__dsh-session-mover#card-zh","repo":"baisama-cloud/dsh-session-mover","commit":"ab3d6e8ef2f6aae2348b76e26ef15e4278f8d1f1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-mover 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话工作区迁移插件。它在侧边栏会话列表加入拖放交互，并由宿主读取会话历史、在目标工作区创建副本、持久化并归档原会话。主要功能包括跨工作区移动、保留完整历史与创建时间、移动后切换当前会话，以及显示成功或失败提示。适合整理多个工作区中的 DSH 会话；无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:101-149","lib/index.js:45-103"]}
{"unit_id":"baisama-cloud__dsh-session-mover#card-en","repo":"baisama-cloud/dsh-session-mover","commit":"ab3d6e8ef2f6aae2348b76e26ef15e4278f8d1f1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-mover adds drag and drop for moving DSH web sessions between workspaces. The host creates a copy with full history, persists it, and archives the original. It also shows results and opens the new copy when moving the active session. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:71-99","lib/index.js:45-103"]}
