{"unit_id":"baisama-cloud__dsh-session-mover#feature-1","repo":"baisama-cloud/dsh-session-mover","commit":"ab3d6e8ef2f6aae2348b76e26ef15e4278f8d1f1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-mover 的功能「拖放迁移」：在会话列表按住会话并拖到其他工作区标题行，即触发迁移；插件读取源会话并在目标工作区创建完整历史的新副本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:101-149","lib/index.js:59-76"]}
